 "about": "The multilingual model's phones (scripts/ml_phones.py): reader sounds and Japanese/Chinese phones as vocabulary keys. English phones where English has the sound; a shared phone (en/_NAME) where it doesn't. Each uses the output row of the unused phone `row` and starts as a copy of `init`.",
